# Starts a new Allied campaign from the main menu: the difficulty prompt, the
# choice of side, and the first mission under way.
at 300 shot main_menu
at 301 click 320 231
at 340 shot difficulty
at 341 key RETURN
at 400 shot choose_side
at 401 click 260 228
at 500 shot mission_start
at 1500 shot mission_under_way
at 1501 quit
